<title>USA: CCI to go forward with Triad acquisition.</title>
<headline>CCI to go forward with Triad acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooperative Computing Inc and its affiliate CCI Acquisition Corp,  said Wednesday that CCI Acquisition can complete its previously announced tender offer for Triad Systems Corp at $9.25 a share.</p>
<p>The companies said they would proceed as a result of the Federal Trade Commission's  acceptance for public comment of CCI's previous agreement with FTC staff.</p>
<p>The companies said that CCI Acquisition expects and intends to complete the tender offer on Feb 27, 10:00 A.M., Eastern Standard Time, as scheduled.</p>
</text>
